00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:46.200
Are you planning to attend
in person or join online?

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:48.000
JESSE HALL: That's today,
and I'm already there.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.080
We'll see you.

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:49.560
So that's it.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.400
Quick and easy.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.600
Integrate Azure.

